Even authenticated, returning full email addresses for all users is excessive. Apply least-privilege response shaping.

**Recommendation:**
```js
// Only return fields the caller is authorized to see
const publicView = u => ({ id: u.id, name: u.name });
res.json(users.map(publicView));
```

