### 10. Hardcoded Port / Listening on All Interfaces (Minor — A05)

**Issue:** `app.listen(3000)` binds to `0.0.0.0`. Behind a reverse proxy this is fine; otherwise consider binding to localhost.

**Fix:**
```js
